{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21793","headline":"有鸟二十章 七 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟羣纸鸢，因风假势童子牵。\n去地渐高人眼乱，世人爲尔羽毛全。\n风吹绳断童子走，余势尚存犹在天。\n愁尔一朝还到地，落在深泥谁复怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}